---
import SectionHeader from '../ui/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="surface-section">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <SectionHeader title="Why Choose Koseli Crafts?" subtitle="Premium quality meets spiritual purpose" />
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🌿</div><h4>Premium Materials</h4><p>We source only the finest sustainably-harvested wood, ensuring durability and natural beauty that lasts for generations.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🎯</div><h4>Precision Crafted</h4><p>Advanced laser technology combines with traditional handicraft techniques to create pieces of exceptional quality and detail.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">✨</div><h4>Spiritual Purpose</h4><p>Every piece is created with intention to inspire daily reflection and bring spiritual meaning to your sacred spaces.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🎁</div><h4>Perfect Gifts</h4><p>Thoughtful, meaningful gifts that touch the heart. Beautiful packaging available for all occasions and celebrations.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🔧</div><h4>Customizable</h4><p>Work with us to create truly personal pieces. Custom scriptures, names, sizes, and finishes available for any vision.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><div class="feature-icon">🌍</div><h4>Worldwide Shipping</h4><p>We ship globally with tracking and insurance. Fast, reliable delivery to bring your sacred art home with care.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
